# Decision 34's reason, refused: the tenant's record of the co-packer in CQ-P01's fixture is also typed an
# organization. A SourceRecord is content, and gist 14.1.0 makes content and organizations disjoint. Read beside
# CQ-P01's fixture, whose run is the near miss. Hand-written; only gate 9 reads it.
@base <https://example.org/inventory-import/> .
@prefix inv: <https://example.org/inventory-import/ontology/> .

<fixture/SourceRecord/test_WorksCoPacker> a inv:Organization .
